' Autonomous Enterprise value / operations boundary visualization
'
' Per CR-ES-011 §20 + ADR-ES-011 §12 + §13.
' Illustrates how Autonomous Enterprise participates in value
' realisation and operations without collapsing into either.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-24)

@startuml autonomous-enterprise-value-operations-boundary

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #2F4F4F
    FontColor #2F4F4F
}

title Autonomous Enterprise, Value / Operations Boundary

rectangle "Autonomous Enterprise" as ae #FFE4B5

rectangle "Value Realisation" as value #E0E8F0
rectangle "Autonomous Value Stream" as avs #E6E6FA
rectangle "Operations" as ops #F0FFF0
rectangle "Autonomous Operations" as aops #E0FFFF
rectangle "Agentic Workflow" as awf #FFFACD

ae --> value : participates
ae --> ops : participates

value --> avs : autonomous-enterprise-realizes-through
ops --> aops : autonomous-enterprise-operates-through
ae --> awf : uses (execution mechanism)

note bottom of ae
  Per AE-AUTO-CON-015 + AE-AUTO-CON-016 + AE-AUTO-CON-017:
  Autonomous Enterprise realises value through
  Autonomous Value Streams and operates through
  Autonomous Operations. Mixed realisation
  across autonomous, agentic, conventional, and
  human-led modes is architecturally valid per
  AE-AUTO-CON-017.
end note

@enduml
